=== Text #1 ===
> Frances Carolyn Sedberry, 66 of Middleburg, FL passed away Thursday,[ May] 17,[ 2018]. Mrs. Sedberry was born in Baton Rouge, LA to the late Cle[a]vern and Betty Grimball Broussard, Jr. She loved her family with a fiery passion.
Mrs. Sedberry was preceded in death by her parents and brother, Cle[a]vern Broussard, III. She is survived by her loving husband,[ Charles] Sedberry, daughter, Betty Ire[ne] Sedberry, two grands[ons],[ Charles] and[ Aaron] Sedberry, sister,[ Doris] Broussard Michelli, brother,[ Donald] Broussard, many cousins, nieces, nephews. She is also survived by several whom she saw as and claimed as daughters, sons, and grandchildren. She will be dearly missed.
Funeral Services will be held 11:00 AM Tuesday, May 22, 2018 in the Chapel of Russell Haven of Rest Funeral Home with Rev[. Ralph] Estevez officiating. Burial will follow in[ Russell] Haven of Rest Cemetery. Visitation with the family will be from 5-7:00 PM Monday at the funeral home.

